<title>UK: Nomura sets warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International Plc said it has issued 400,000 American-style call warrants on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p>One unit of the index is controlled by one warrant.</p>
<p> INIT STRIKE     17,303.65 YEN	   ISSUE PRICE  $19.66</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 11.APR.97-09.JAN.98   PAYDATE	28.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> NOTES	     FINAL EXERCISE PRICE WILL BE THE LOWER OF</p>
<p>		     THE INITIAL EXERCISE PRICE OR THE LOWEST</p>
<p>		     REFERENCE PRICE DURING LOOKBACK PERIOD</p>
<p>		     (13.JAN.97 - 10.APR.97)</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
